# Zot inventory

List repositories, tags, manifests, and referrers. Prefer MCP when connected; else Zot API or authenticated UI.

Never invent repository / tag digests — list/resolve first. Resolve the
registry base URL from operator config. Report repo + tag + digest — never
paste registry credentials.
